sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Store user
  participant API as Import API
  participant Service as Import service
  participant DB as Database
  User->>API: Upload CSV
  API->>Service: importCsv(jwt, file)
  Service->>Service: Enforce limits, parse, validate order groups
  Service->>DB: Create PROCESSING batch and staging rows
  loop each accepted order
    Service->>DB: Check (store, source system, source order) key
    alt Existing order, same content
      DB-->>Service: Existing transaction
      Service->>Service: Count duplicate, preserve existing order
    else Existing order, changed content
      DB-->>Service: Existing transaction differs
      Service->>Service: Count conflict, reject order
    else New valid order
      Service->>DB: Persist sales transaction and items
      Note over Service,DB: Import does not write inventory batches
    end
  end
  Service->>DB: Finalize counts and terminal batch status
  Service-->>API: Import summary
  API-->>User: Import outcomes
